Richard Harrison <rjh@zaretto.com>
    Project lead. Flight dynamics and systems models, cockpit model and operation,
    sound, Canvas HUD / MPCD / VSD / TEWS, revisions to the external 3D model
    (engines, ramps, animations, speedbrake), weapons and radar integration.

Enrique Laso (Flying toaster)
    Original external 3D model (2015).

Nikolai V. Chr.
    Weapons, radar, damage model, MPCD SIT display, HUD (2015 onwards).

Gene Buckle (GeneB)
    Photographs and measurements of the cockpit of F-15C 80-0007 (f15sim.com),
    used as the source for the cockpit textures.

Colin Geniet
    Nasal/datalink.nas

Anders Gidenstam
    Nasal/dual-control.nas, Nasal/mp-network.nas

Justin Nicholson
    Nasal/iff.nas

Fabrizio Fracaroli
    Models/Effects/Vapour/Vapour.xml, Vapour2.xml

xii (Alexis)
    F-14 origin of the radar and missile code, since extensively modified.

